        "id": "objective-and-full-gradient",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-objective",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "目标函数与全量梯度",
        "markdown": "深度学习的目标函数通常是训练集上每个样本损失的平均值。给定 $n$ 个样本，记 $f_i(\\mathbf{x})$ 为第 $i$ 个样本的损失，参数向量为 $\\mathbf{x}$，则\n\n$$f(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} f_i(\\mathbf{x}).$$\n\n对参数求梯度得到\n\n$$\\nabla f(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\nabla f_i(\\mathbf{x}).$$\n\n教材指出，梯度下降每次迭代都要遍历全部 $n$ 个样本，计算代价为 $\\mathcal{O}(n)$，随 $n$ 线性增长；训练集很大时单次迭代的代价会很高。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000087"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "优化算法",
                "随机梯度下降"
              ],
              "lineStart": 18982,
              "lineEnd": 19278,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0005/images/37c80b1b92f78de593c4ff4602f89894aa2519e77ac10e124c9f275f9d98b7fc.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/6cf7361bb9d89eace84af35810b87d2753f26037be1297cad75cfa9e913a2f59.jpg",
                "parts/part-0005/images/4bbd9f0369b0e5f8eba70e51eb9975cb2a9bb75744c7618393601ca8c883b282.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "00944ed21a2d20ec5f78127852303799aa7a534d93117a49dbb8e54f2928e475"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-full-gradient-expensive",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-objective",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么全量梯度成为瓶颈",
        "markdown": "代价随样本数线性增长，意味着数据规模翻倍时单次参数更新也要翻倍。深度模型训练往往需要成千上万次更新，如果每次都要扫完整份数据集，总计算量就会被样本数和迭代数同时放大。随机梯度下降正是针对这一瓶颈设计的：它放弃“每次都用精确梯度”，换取“每次更新都很便宜”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "objective-and-full-gradient"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sgd-update-rule",
        "moduleId": "sgd-update-and-unbiasedness",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "随机梯度更新规则",
        "markdown": "随机梯度下降在每次迭代中从 $\\{1, \\ldots, n\\}$ 均匀随机采样一个样本索引 $i$，只用该样本的梯度更新参数：\n\n$$\\mathbf{x} \\leftarrow \\mathbf{x} - \\eta \\nabla f_i(\\mathbf{x}),$$\n\n其中 $\\eta$ 是学习率。这样每次迭代的计算代价从梯度下降的 $\\mathcal{O}(n)$ 降到常数 $\\mathcal{O}(1)$，与训练集大小无关。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000087"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "优化算法",
                "随机梯度下降"
              ],
              "lineStart": 18982,
              "lineEnd": 19278,
              "assetRefs": [
